Package: datagouv
Title: Tools to Download and Explore Datasets from the French Open Data Platform
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c( 
    person(given = "Pierre", 
           family = "Gloaguen", 
           role = "aut", 
           email = "pierre.gloaguen@univ-ubs.fr"), 
    person(given = "Aymeric",
           family = "Stamm",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), 
           email = "aymeric.stamm@cnrs.fr",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8725-3654")))
Description: Provides a client for the public API of data.gouv.fr, the French
    government's open data platform. It lets you list the available datasets,
    download their resources and compute summary metrics (size, number of
    columns, missing-value rate, ...). The requests are built on top of
    'httr2'.
